Server init.
>> a := Blob okusha: 4.
a bytes: ( Uhlu okusha ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob okusha: 4.
b bytes: ( Uhlu okusha ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a okusha.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Okuphumayo bhala: ( a ^ c ), umugqa-omusha. } bamba: { :e Okuphumayo bhala: e, umugqa-omusha. }, qala.
a khulula.
b khulula.
